 "brief_title": "Lipitor Trial To Study The Effect Of Torcetrpib/Atorvastatin To Atorvastatin Alone.",
 "official_title": "A Phase 3, Double-Blind, Randomized, Multisite Trial Of The Efficacy, Safety, And Tolerability Of The Fixed Combination Torcetrapib/Atorvastatin Administered Orally, Once Daily For 12 Months, Compared To Atorvastatin Alone, Titrated Based On NCEP ATP-III LDL-C Goals In Subjects With Fredrickson Types IIa And IIb Dyslipidemias",
